{
  "$comment": "Scripted conversations with goosic-service. Each exchange starts from a service that has just started, and every step's request must produce exactly the response beside it. These pin behaviour rather than shape: which refusal wins when two apply, that a claim moves the generation, that an equal sample sequence is refused. Generated by driving the Rust service, never by hand.",
  "protocolVersion": "0.3.0",
  "exchanges": [
    {
      "name": "claim-then-release",
      "why": "The baseline lease. A successful claim increments the generation, so the number a shell sends is never the number it must send next.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "Nothing owns playback yet, so generation 0 is the current one.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x1-1\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x1-1\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":0},\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1},\"error\":null}"
        },
        {
          "why": "Releasing uses the generation the claim returned, not the one it sent.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x1-2\",\"command\":\"playback.release\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x1-2\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"none\",\"generation\":2,\"sampleSequence\":0},\"owner\":\"none\",\"generation\":2},\"error\":null}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "owner-conflict",
      "why": "A second host asking for a lease somebody already holds. The owner check runs before the generation check, so a stale second claimant is told what is really wrong rather than being sent to refresh a generation that would not help.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "The first host takes the lease.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x2-1\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x2-1\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":0},\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1},\"error\":null}"
        },
        {
          "why": "A second host asks with the correct current generation and is still refused.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x2-2\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"localDownloadedFile\",\"generation\":1}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x2-2\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"ownerConflict\",\"message\":\"another playback owner is already active\"}}"
        },
        {
          "why": "And with a stale generation the answer is still ownerConflict, not generationMismatch.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x2-3\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"localDownloadedFile\",\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x2-3\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"ownerConflict\",\"message\":\"another playback owner is already active\"}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "stale-generation",
      "why": "A host that kept the generation it claimed with, or one that missed a reset. Every leased command rechecks it, which is what makes a stale renderer unable to keep reporting after the lease moved.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "Claim, which moves the generation to 1.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x3-1\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x3-1\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":0},\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1},\"error\":null}"
        },
        {
          "why": "Sampling with the generation that was sent, not the one returned.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x3-2\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0,\"sequence\":1}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x3-2\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"generationMismatch\",\"message\":\"playback generation does not match the active lease\"}}"
        },
        {
          "why": "Releasing with the same stale number is refused for the same reason.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x3-3\",\"command\":\"playback.release\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x3-3\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"generationMismatch\",\"message\":\"playback generation does not match the active lease\"}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "non-monotonic-sample",
      "why": "Sample sequences must strictly increase. Equal is refused as well as lesser, which is the half a client that guards with `<` gets wrong.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "Claim resets the sequence to 0.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-1\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-1\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":0},\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1},\"error\":null}"
        },
        {
          "why": "The first sample.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-2\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sequence\":1}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-2\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":1},\"sequence\":1,\"markerAccepted\":false},\"error\":null}"
        },
        {
          "why": "The same sequence again, which a retry after a lost response would send.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-3\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sequence\":1}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-3\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"nonMonotonicSampleSequence\",\"message\":\"sample sequence must increase monotonically\"}}"
        },
        {
          "why": "Going backwards.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-4\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sequence\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-4\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"nonMonotonicSampleSequence\",\"message\":\"sample sequence must increase monotonically\"}}"
        },
        {
          "why": "A refused sample does not consume the sequence: 2 still works.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-5\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sequence\":2}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x4-5\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":2},\"sequence\":2,\"markerAccepted\":false},\"error\":null}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "advertisement-marker-is-not-a-lifecycle-signal",
      "why": "An advertisement is reported and never bypassed, and reporting one must not release the owner or move the generation. A shell that treated a marker as a stop would hand the lease away mid-advertisement.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "Claim.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x5-1\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x5-1\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":0},\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1},\"error\":null}"
        },
        {
          "why": "A marked sample is accepted and says so.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x5-2\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sequence\":1,\"marker\":\"advertisement\"}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x5-2\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":1},\"sequence\":1,\"markerAccepted\":true},\"error\":null}"
        },
        {
          "why": "The owner and generation are unchanged, so ordinary audio continues.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x5-3\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sequence\":2}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x5-3\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":2},\"sequence\":2,\"markerAccepted\":false},\"error\":null}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "sample-without-a-lease",
      "why": "A renderer that produced sound before claiming. This is the exchange that proves a host cannot report playback it was never given permission for.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "No claim has happened.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x6-1\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0,\"sequence\":1}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x6-1\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"noActiveOwner\",\"message\":\"no playback owner is active\"}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "owner-mismatch",
      "why": "The lease is held, the generation is right, and the wrong host is reporting. Two renderers exist on every platform and only one may sound at a time.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "The web host claims.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x7-1\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x7-1\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1,\"sampleSequence\":0},\"owner\":\"officialWebView\",\"generation\":1},\"error\":null}"
        },
        {
          "why": "The local file host reports against somebody else's lease.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x7-2\",\"command\":\"playback.sample\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"localDownloadedFile\",\"generation\":1,\"sequence\":1}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x7-2\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"ownerMismatch\",\"message\":\"sample owner does not match the active lease\"}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "unsupported-protocol-version",
      "why": "A shell built against a different protocol. The service answers rather than closing the pipe, so the shell can say what is wrong instead of reporting a dead service.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "A well-formed request that speaks the wrong version.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.4.0\",\"requestId\":\"x8-1\",\"command\":\"state.get\",\"payload\":{}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x8-1\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"unsupportedProtocolVersion\",\"message\":\"expected protocol version 0.3.0\"}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "unknown-command",
      "why": "A newer shell against an older service. Same reason: a named refusal beats a silence a client has to time out on.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "A command this service does not have.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x9-1\",\"command\":\"playback.rewind\",\"payload\":{}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x9-1\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"unknownCommand\",\"message\":\"command is not supported\"}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "invalid-request-payload",
      "why": "The command is real and the payload is not usable. This is refused before the authority sees it, so a malformed request can never move the lease.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "why": "A claim with no owner.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x10-1\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"generation\":0}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x10-1\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"invalidRequest\",\"message\":\"claim requires an owner\"}}"
        },
        {
          "why": "A claim with no generation.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x10-2\",\"command\":\"playback.claim\",\"payload\":{\"owner\":\"officialWebView\"}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x10-2\",\"ok\":false,\"payload\":null,\"error\":{\"code\":\"invalidRequest\",\"message\":\"claim requires generation\"}}"
        },
        {
          "why": "Nothing moved: the lease is still free at generation 0.",
          "request": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x10-3\",\"command\":\"state.get\",\"payload\":{}}",
          "response": "{\"protocolVersion\":\"0.3.0\",\"requestId\":\"x10-3\",\"ok\":true,\"payload\":{\"state\":{\"accountId\":null,\"owner\":\"none\",\"generation\":0,\"sampleSequence\":0}},\"error\":null}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
